","user":"U776661HA","text":"プライベートいけるなら乗り換えるかな....まじで YAK すぎるんだよな....","ts":"1629956001.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OgU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e3c7021-fcce-4f3f-837e-ec5ff4dcb70f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実際の `github.event_name` と `github.actor` はこの条件に合致してないんですよね?","ts":"1629955999.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Akh5n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56abc233-d3dc-4fce-9dca-f326f64eb2a4","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```    if: ${{ always() \u0026amp;\u0026amp; ((github.event_name == 'pull_request_target' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; github.actor == 'dependabot[bot]') || (github.event_name != 'pull_request_target' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; github.actor != 'dependabot[bot]')) }}```","ts":"1629955982.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p/a="}]},{"client_msg_id":"536bfe9d-4dde-4b60-90fb-dba873fc56ca","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"プライベートリポジトリもいけてます","ts":"1629955965.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0IzJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b4b3706-c3db-4eec-87eb-c4377313912e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"テスト用のリポジトリ見ると\n\u003chttps://github.com/moritamori/dependabot-testing2/blob/master/.github/workflows/test.yml\u003e\n分けてるから、なんかセットにしちゃうとマズいのかな?","ts":"1629955963.013500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/moritamori/dependabot-testing2/blob/master/.github/workflows/test.yml | test.yml\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/moritamori/dependabot-testing2/blob/master/.github/workflows/test.yml | test.yml\u003e","text":"```\non: \n  push:\n  pull_request_target:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\nname: Test\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    if: (github.event_name == 'pull_request_target' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; github.actor == 'dependabot[bot]') || (github.event_name != 'pull_request_target' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; github.actor != 'dependabot[bot]') \n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n        if: (github.event_name == 'pull_request_target' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; github.actor == 'dependabot[bot]')\n        with:\n          ref: ${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha }}\n          fetch-depth: 0\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n        if: (github.event_name != 'pull_request_target' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; github.actor != 'dependabot[bot]')\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n      - name: SonarCloud Scan\n        uses: SonarSource/sonarcloud-github-action@master\n        env:\n          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}  # Needed to get PR information, if any\n          SONAR_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.SONAR_TOKEN }}\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/moritamori/dependabot-testing2|moritamori/dependabot-testing2\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DYbN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35c750ef-ab04-4895-96fa-f05c6dfe3a2a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"文字列止めてみる","ts":"1629955956.013100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ZEQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4268fad6-aad7-43a3-b0f8-c3d5c9f903c0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"状況変わらず","ts":"1629955910.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wbCq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"456c3f9b-e5a4-4ead-b9e2-f51f486af604","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"renovate はプライベートリポジトリもいけます？","ts":"1629955878.010900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wx92"}]}